# W7i, guest b (k2): from @200 its link hangs open for 7 s at a time (eight cuts, 0.2 s apart); it plays on near (442,-10) (W7g's
# spot: the wander towards (-150,-60) crosses stag0101's rock slope, which a k2 character does not survive). Taken out by its lag debt
# it plays on apart (alone in its engine, its seat kept). Before fix-021 it stayed in a's stage group: present stayed 2.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log b joined a
follow 40 until epoch>=@200
wander 442 -10 8 until present=1 fail epoch>=@300
log b plays on apart
wander 442 -10 8 until epoch>=@315 fail stage=stagml11
log b done
